msgstr "@george4_oops 哎呀……我還在想「視窗」到底是什麼意思。\\>\\n\\@george4_golly 算了，只能讓\\p自己去找答案囉。"

msgid "@george4_omg Oh! Of course!"
msgstr "@george4_omg 喔！當然囉！"

msgid "@george4_smile That just means you need things that contain yellow phosphor!\\>\\n\\@george4 They glow for a long time!"
msgstr "@george4_smile 那個意思只是說你需要含有黃燐的東西！\\>\\n\\@george4 這種東西會長時間發光！"

